Editing an existing collection

Optional status may be Active or Archived to change lifecycle state. Omit status to leave it unchanged. To remove a collection, use DELETE (not status).

When editing a dynamic collection, you can also change the search expression of the collection.

```http
PUT /collection/f93aad563b034777b7daa842008d4f99
{
  "name" : "New name for the collection",
  "searchExpression" : {
    "expression" : "Classification.Name = 'MyClass'",
    "languages" : [
      "c2bd4f9bbb954bcb80c31e924c9c26dc"
    ]
  },
  "tag" : "<selectable>new content</selectable>"
}
```
